# ============================================================================
# PARAMS for aws/iam/role/create-inline-policy-for-role — NO CREDENTIALS.
#
# This integration operates on a role that already exists — it does not
# create one. Run aws/iam/role/create-role first if you need it provisioned.
#
# PutRolePolicy is a whole-document replace under POLICY_NAME specifically:
# other inline policies on the same role, under other names, are untouched.
# ============================================================================

ROLE_NAME=
# The inline policy's own name — distinct from any managed policy name.
POLICY_NAME=
# The full inline policy document, as JSON text on one line (or a quoted
# multi-line value — this file's parser unescapes \n inside double quotes).
# Example: '{"Version":"2012-10-17","Statement":[{"Effect":"Allow","Action":"s3:GetObject","Resource":"arn:aws:s3:::example-bucket/*"}]}'
POLICY_DOCUMENT=
